Scope

This license covers ScarEye's original SteamPipeline work: the scripts in
Editor/, the VDF template in Editor/Templates/, and this package's
documentation.

It does not cover SteamworksSDK~/. That folder is the Steamworks SDK from
Valve Corporation. Those files are not copyrighted by ScarEye and are not
licensed under the MIT License. They remain under Valve's Steamworks SDK terms.
